Screen can only interact with ViewModel
Screen should not contain business logic
ViewModel handles UI state and calls UseCase
UseCase defines business rules
Repository abstracts data sources
Service communicates with Firebase/API
Mapper converts raw data ↔ model
Model defines data structure only

Provider (DI + state injection)
   ↓
Screen (UI)
   ↓
ViewModel (UI state + logic)
   ↓
UseCase (business rules)
   ↓
Repository
   ↓
Service
   ↓
Mapper
   ↓
Model

Model	What data is
Mapper	Convert data
Service	Fetch/Save data
Repository	Decide where data comes from
UseCase	What the system should do (If removing the UseCase changes nothing except an extra file → don’t create it)
ViewModel	What UI should show
Screen	Display only